# The level 52 Priest class chain: Cenarion Aid (8254) from your class
# trainer to Ogtinc in Azshara, then Of Coursers We Know (8255), The Ichor
# of Undeath (8256) and Blood of Morphaz (8257), handed in to Greta
# Mosshoof in Felwood.
# Sources: quests.json, npcs.json and items.json (Questie 12.1.0 and
# Questie-Forever) for the givers, drops and spawns; travel.json for the
# flight points. Forever's quest data (quest 8254, checked
# 2026-10-14) lists Brother Joshua (Stormwind), High Priest Rohan
# (Ironforge) and Ur'kyo (Orgrimmar) as the givers of Cenarion Aid.
# Rewards: Forever's change notes for Blood of Morphaz
# (data/local/quest-audit/: "Rewards: no longer
# Choice of Blessed Prayer Beads, Choice of Circle of Hope, Choice of
# Woestave") remove the item choice, and they list no new reward: the chain
# pays experience and money only (6350 XP and 1g55s for 8257).
# The Blood of Morphaz drops from Morphaz, an elite boss in the Sunken
# Temple: this chain needs a dungeon group. The data has no position for
# Morphaz or the dungeon entrance; the entrance point (69,54, the temple in
# the middle of the Pool of Tears) is from players' reports.
# The Ichor of Undeath drops from undead all over the world (4-13%): in
# Azshara, the Lingering Highborne (levels 48-50, about 10%) haunt the Ruins
# of Eldarath below Ogtinc's cliffs, and Highborne Apparitions and Lichlings
# (45-47, about 8%) the ruins near Talrendis Point.
# Based on data, not play: the beta caps at level 30 until launch on
# 4 November, so nothing here has been checked in game.

# Preparation: Forever quest 8256 asks for one Ichor of Undeath after
# 8255. Existing items can be kept; the stages are still handed in in order.

step Cenarion Aid (Alliance)
  only Alliance
  zone Stormwind City
  tip At 50 Brother Joshua in Stormwind's Cathedral of Light or High Priest Rohan in Ironforge's Hall of Mysteries offers it.
  level 50
  accept 8254 npc 5489                        -- Brother Joshua

step Cenarion Aid (Horde)
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip At 50 Ur'kyo in Orgrimmar's Valley of Spirits offers it.
  level 50
  accept 8254 npc 6018                        -- Ur'kyo

step Ogtinc
  zone Azshara
  tip Ogtinc lives atop the cliffs north-east of the Ruins of Eldarath. Alliance: fly to Talrendis Point; Horde: fly to Valormok.
  getfp "Talrendis Point" only Alliance
  getfp "Valormok" only Horde
  turnin 8254                                 -- Ogtinc
  accept 8255

step Of Coursers We Know
  tip Mosshoof Coursers graze all over Azshara; about one in three drops a Healthy Courser Gland. Keep any Ichor of Undeath you loot: Ogtinc's next stage asks for one.
  collect 20027 quest 8255.1                  -- Healthy Courser Gland

step Ogtinc
  turnin 8255                                 -- Ogtinc
  accept 8256

step The Ichor of Undeath
  tip Already carrying an Ichor of Undeath? It counts as soon as you take this stage. Otherwise any undead can drop it. The Lingering Highborne in the Ruins of Eldarath, below Ogtinc's cliffs, are the nearest; Highborne Apparitions and Lichlings haunt the ruins near Talrendis Point.
  collect 7972 quest 8256.1                   -- Ichor of Undeath

step Ogtinc
  turnin 8256                                 -- Ogtinc
  accept 8257

step Morphaz in the Sunken Temple
  zone Swamp of Sorrows
  tip Morphaz is an elite dragon boss inside the Sunken Temple, a level 50 dungeon: bring a group of five. The temple stands in the middle of the Pool of Tears; swim down into it to reach the entrance. Horde: fly to Stonard; Alliance: fly to Darkshire or Nethergarde Keep and ride on.
  collect 20025 quest 8257.1 @69.0,54.0       -- Blood of Morphaz: the Sunken Temple entrance

step Greta Mosshoof
  zone Felwood
  tip Greta Mosshoof is at the Emerald Sanctuary in southern Felwood.
  turnin 8257                                 -- Greta Mosshoof
